@module steps ; One step of an enemy or an object, and the shifts of their graphics
@about StepRight, StepDown, StepLeft and StepUp take HL at a record's x (and y after it), the mover's size in StepWidth / StepHeight cells and the limits; between whole cells they just step 2 pixels, at a cell edge they test the next column or row for a wall (CellBlockedColumn / CellBlockedRow). They return Z when the move hit the limit or a wall, so the mover turns. An item in the way is passed over (FoundItem).

